+    backend's ``decode_cuda_graph_metadata`` dominates its graph-state memory.
+    PDMux decode steps are serialized (stream groups are only switched after
+    both streams are synchronized), and every replay rewrites the table before
+    launching, so the groups can share one allocation. Must run before capture
+    (captured graphs bake the pointer). Opt-in via
+    SGLANG_PDMUX_EAGLE_DRAFT_SHARE_PAGE_TABLE=1. Returns the bytes freed.
